%------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% File     : time-total.ax
% Domain   : gUFOevents -- instants are totally ordered
%
% Kept apart from time.ax because most problems do not need it, and trichotomy
% is expensive to search over. It is needed wherever an argument has to compare
% two instants it was not handed in order -- as in the uniqueness of the
% classification a projection reports.
%
% This is why event-sourcing/README.md says to date every event to the second:
% a log dated only to the day cannot order two events on the same day, and the
% fold needs a total order. Here that requirement becomes an axiom.
%
% Requires : time.ax
%------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fof(tlt_total, axiom,
    ! [T, U] : ( tlt(T, U) | T = U | tlt(U, T) ) ).

%------------------------------------------------------------------------------
